    <node id="step:feature-3.27/01"><data key="label">`POST /support/requests` with kind, subject and body returns an 8-character `reference`. `GET /support/requests` and `GET /support/requests/{id}` list and …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.27", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.27/02"><data key="label">`GET /support/requests/{id}/messages` and `POST /support/requests/{id}/messages` form a thread between the requester and staff.</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.27", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.27/03"><data key="label">A staff reply queues `support.notify_reply`, which notifies the requester (`account/support_reply`, link `/help/requests/{id}`) without the message text. …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.27", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.27/04"><data key="label">Signed-out people use `POST /support/contact` with a `contact_email` (202 with a reference).</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.27", "order": 4}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.27/05"><data key="label">Staff with the `support` role see `GET /support/queue` (security and privacy first) and change status with `PATCH /support/queue/{id}` (audited). …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.27", "order": 5}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.27/06"><data key="label">`GET /legal` (public) returns the current terms and privacy versions and every consent type's version.</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.27", "order": 6}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.28/01"><data key="label">Consents. `GET /me/consents`, `POST /me/consents` (type and the current version from `GET /legal`), `DELETE /me/consents/{consentType}`. Types: `terms` and …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.28", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.28/02"><data key="label">Export. `POST /me/export` (recent re-authentication, `export` rate limit) queues `privacy.export`, which builds a ZIP of JSON sections for every personal …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.28", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.28/03"><data key="label">Deletion. `GET /me/deletion-request` explains the consequences, what is retained and the effect on each group (with codes). `POST /me/deletion-request` …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.28", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.28/04"><data key="label">Deactivation. `POST /me/deactivate` (re-authentication) sets the account to `deactivated`, revokes every session and records a security event. Signing in …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.28", "order": 4}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.29/01"><data key="label">`GET /limits` returns the values from configuration and the caller's storage use. `note_code` (`fair_use_same_for_everyone`) localizes the explanation.</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.29", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.29/02"><data key="label">Enforcement lives where the action happens: storage in `POST /files/upload-intent` (`storage_quota_exceeded` with used and quota bytes), open-record caps in …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.29", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.3/01"><data key="label">Home reads `GET /dashboard/widgets` for the saved layout (widget key, position, visibility, settings). New widgets added by the server appear at the end, …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.3", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.3/02"><data key="label">Period widgets come from one call, `GET /dashboard/summary`, with `range` or `from`/`to` and optional filters (`account_id`, `category_id`, `merchant_id`, …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.3", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.3/03"><data key="label">Planning widgets come from one call, `GET /dashboard/planning`, which is independent of the period filter: up to 5 active budgets (fullest first), up to 8 …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.3", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.3/04"><data key="label">Hidden planning widgets are not requested. Saving the layout calls `PATCH /dashboard/widgets` with the full list, or `{"reset": true}`.</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.3", "order": 4}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.3/05"><data key="label">Cards link to their full screens; widgets that drill down open the transactions list with the same filters.</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.3", "order": 5}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.30/01"><data key="label">The platform role lives on `users.platform_role` (`user`, `support`, `admin`) and is set by the owner in the database; there is no API to change it.</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.30", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.30/02"><data key="label">`GET /admin/usage?days=30` (admins only) calls the `admin_usage` database function: active, new and pending-deletion users, stored bytes by area, …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.30", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.30/03"><data key="label">The support queue and staff moderation are described in [3.27](#327-help-and-support) and [3.21](#321-moderation-and-appeals).</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.30", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.30/04"><data key="label">The web navigation shows a Staff section only to staff roles.</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.30", "order": 4}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.4/01"><data key="label">`POST /accounts` (with `Idempotency-Key`) creates `financial_accounts` and, when there is an opening balance, an `opening_balance` ledger event. Credit …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.4", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.4/02"><data key="label">A balance is always the opening balance plus the sum of `account_ledger_entries`. `GET /accounts` lists own and household-shared accounts with balances; …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.4", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.4/03"><data key="label">`PATCH /accounts/{id}` edits name, label, icon, colour, last digits, `include_in_overview`, credit limit, statement and due days, order, and sharing …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.4", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.4/04"><data key="label">`POST /accounts/{id}/adjustments` (with `Idempotency-Key` and a reason) records an `adjustment` transaction so the balance matches reality, with an audit trail.</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.4", "order": 4}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.4/05"><data key="label">Lifecycle: `POST /accounts/{id}/archive`, `POST /accounts/{id}/close` (balance must be zero), `POST /accounts/{id}/restore`.</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.4", "order": 5}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.4/06"><data key="label">Payment methods: `GET /payment-methods`, `POST /payment-methods`, `PATCH /payment-methods/{id}` (with `version`), `DELETE /payment-methods/{id}` (deletes an …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.4", "order": 6}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.5/01"><data key="label">Create. The form posts `POST /transactions` with an `Idempotency-Key`. The service checks that the account is active and the caller's own, validates the …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.5", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.5/02"><data key="label">Transfer. `POST /transactions/transfers` (with `Idempotency-Key`) writes a `transfers` row and two linked legs, plus an optional fee transaction. A …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.5", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.5/03"><data key="label">Refunds and reimbursements. `POST /transactions/{id}/refunds` (with `Idempotency-Key`, `type: refund | reimbursement`) creates a transaction linked to the …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.5", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.5/04"><data key="label">Edit. `PATCH /transactions/{id}` with `version`. When the amount, date, account or balance effect changes, the ledger gets a reversing entry for the old …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.5", "order": 4}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.5/05"><data key="label">Void and restore. `DELETE /transactions/{id}` sets `status = voided` with reversing ledger entries; `POST /transactions/{id}/restore` undoes it. `POST …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.5", "order": 5}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.5/06"><data key="label">Bulk and duplicate. `POST /transactions/bulk-update` changes category, tags or account for many; `POST /transactions/{id}/duplicate` copies one of the …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.5", "order": 6}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.5/07"><data key="label">Attachments. Upload a file with purpose `transaction_attachment` ([2.10](#210-files-and-storage)), then `POST /transactions/{id}/attachments`; list with …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.5", "order": 7}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.5/08"><data key="label">History. `GET /transactions/{id}/audit` shows who changed what and when (actor `user`, `system`, `import`, `recurring`, `integration`).</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.5", "order": 8}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.5/09"><data key="label">Search. `GET /transactions` and `GET /transactions/search` take the same filters: range or dates, type, account, category, merchant, payment method, tag, …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.5", "order": 9}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.5/10"><data key="label">After commit, the outbox routes `transaction.*`, `transfer.created` and `transactions.bulk_updated` events to `budgets.evaluate`.</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.5", "order": 10}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.6/01"><data key="label">Categories. Every new user starts with starter categories (with `system_key` for localization). `GET /categories`, `POST /categories`, `GET …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.6", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.6/02"><data key="label">Merging. `POST /categories/merge` (with a preview mode) and `POST /merchants/merge/preview` then `POST /merchants/merge` move every reference: transactions, …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.6", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.6/03"><data key="label">Merchants. `GET /merchants` (active unless `status` says otherwise, cursor-paged), `GET /merchants/{id}` with spending history, `PATCH /merchants/{id}`, …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.6", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.6/04"><data key="label">Tags. `GET /tags`, `POST /tags`, `GET /tags/{id}` (with usage), `PATCH /tags/{id}` (rename, recolor, archive), `DELETE /tags/{id}`.</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.6", "order": 4}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.6/05"><data key="label">Rules. `GET /category-rules`, `POST /category-rules`, `GET /category-rules/{id}`, `PUT /category-rules/{id}`, `DELETE /category-rules/{id}`. A rule matches …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.6", "order": 5}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.7/01"><data key="label">`POST /budgets` with type, period, limit, currency, allocations, filters (included accounts, excluded categories, merchants), rollover policy and cap, …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.7", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.7/02"><data key="label">`GET /budgets` and `GET /budgets/{id}` return progress: spent, limit, remaining, `pace` (`under_pace`, `on_track`, `ahead_of_pace`, `over_budget`) and …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.7", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.7/03"><data key="label">Any transaction change emits an outbox event that queues a debounced `budgets.evaluate` for the owner (or the group). The job recomputes progress, writes …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.7", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.7/04"><data key="label">For each new alert the job creates a `budget` notification (high priority at 100 % or more) unless the person snoozed that budget's alerts. `GET …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.7", "order": 4}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.7/05"><data key="label">Sharing: `POST /budgets/{id}/members`, `PATCH /budgets/{id}/members/{userId}` (role `editor` or `viewer`), `DELETE /budgets/{id}/members/{userId}`. Members …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.7", "order": 5}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.7/06"><data key="label">Group budgets (`group_id`) count all of the group's expenses and can be split between current members.</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.7", "order": 6}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.7/07"><data key="label">Lifecycle: `POST /budgets/{id}/pause`, `POST /budgets/{id}/resume`, `DELETE /budgets/{id}` (archive), `POST /budgets/{id}/restore`. `PATCH /budgets/{id}` …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.7", "order": 7}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.8/01"><data key="label">Rules. `POST /recurring-rules` (with `Idempotency-Key`) stores the schedule (`frequency`, `interval_count`/`interval_unit`, `by_month_day`, `by_weekday`, …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.8", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.8/02"><data key="label">Generation. Every 15 minutes `recurring.generate` materializes occurrences up to now and ahead (`recurring_occurrences`, unique per rule and date), …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.8", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.8/03"><data key="label">Occurrences. `POST /recurring-occurrences/{id}/actions` (with `Idempotency-Key`): `skip`, `reopen`, `postpone`, `set_amount`, `confirm` (record the …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.8", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.8/04"><data key="label">Rule actions. `PATCH /recurring-rules/{id}` edits this and future occurrences: if the dates do not change, postponed and own-amount occurrences are kept; if …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.8", "order": 4}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.8/05"><data key="label">Bills. `POST /bills` (with `Idempotency-Key`) creates a bill with its own schedule, provider, amount, payment account and optional document. The bill's …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.8", "order": 5}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.8/06"><data key="label">Calendar. `GET /calendar?from&amp;to` merges recurring occurrences, bills, shared group recurring expenses, subscription renewals, trial ends and goal target …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.8", "order": 6}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.9/01"><data key="label">`POST /subscriptions` stores a manual subscription (status `trial` when a trial end is given, otherwise `active`) and a `created` event. Duplicate warnings …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.9", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.9/02"><data key="label">Detection. Daily, `subscriptions.detect_all` queues `subscriptions.detect` per person; `POST /subscriptions/detections/refresh` queues it on demand. The …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.9", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.9/03"><data key="label">Payments. `GET /subscriptions/{id}/payment-candidates` suggests recorded charges; `POST /subscriptions/{id}/payments` (with `Idempotency-Key`) links one, …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.9", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.9/04"><data key="label">Renewals. The hourly `subscriptions.renewals` job sends reminders `reminder_days_before` a renewal and before a trial ends, and moves the renewal date forward.</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.9", "order": 4}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.9/05"><data key="label">Cancelling. `POST /subscriptions/{id}/cancellation-started` moves to `cancellation_pending` with a checklist (`PATCH …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.9", "order": 5}</data></node>
    <node id="step:feature-3.9/06"><data key="label">`GET /subscriptions/summary` returns normalized monthly and annual totals per currency, upcoming renewals and trials ending. `PATCH /subscriptions/{id}` …</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:feature-3.9", "order": 6}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-01/01"><data key="label">Sign up with email, password and consents</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-01", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-01/02"><data key="label">Open the emailed verification link</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-01", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-01/03"><data key="label">Sign in and load the session</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-01", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-02/01"><data key="label">Walk through (or skip) the setup steps</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-02", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-02/02"><data key="label">Create a first account and goal by hand</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-02", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-02/03"><data key="label">Land on the dashboard</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-02", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-03/01"><data key="label">Create an account with an opening balance</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-03", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-03/02"><data key="label">Open the account and its balance</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-03", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-04/01"><data key="label">Record an expense or income (Idempotency-Key)</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-04", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-04/02"><data key="label">See it in the list and on the dashboard</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-04", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-05/01"><data key="label">Edit with the record version</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-05", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-05/02"><data key="label">Read the change history</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-05", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-05/03"><data key="label">Delete (void) and restore</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-05", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-06/01"><data key="label">Create a transfer (optionally with a fee or FX)</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-06", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-06/02"><data key="label">Delete and restore it as one unit</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-06", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-07/01"><data key="label">Record a refund against the original expense</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-07", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-08/01"><data key="label">Create a budget with alert thresholds</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-08", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-08/02"><data key="label">Spend against it</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-08", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-08/03"><data key="label">Worker evaluates progress and raises one alert per threshold</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-08", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-08/04"><data key="label">See and dismiss or snooze the alert</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-08", "order": 4}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-09/01"><data key="label">Create a bill with its schedule</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-09", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-09/02"><data key="label">Worker generates occurrences and due reminders</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-09", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-09/03"><data key="label">Mark it paid from an account</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-09", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-09/04"><data key="label">See it on the planning calendar</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-09", "order": 4}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-10/01"><data key="label">Add a subscription with its renewal date</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-10", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-10/02"><data key="label">Worker sends renewal and trial-ending reminders once</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-10", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-10/03"><data key="label">See renewals on the calendar and dashboard</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-10", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-11/01"><data key="label">Upload the receipt pages (intent, content, complete)</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-11", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-11/02"><data key="label">Optionally read it (extraction job)</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-11", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-11/03"><data key="label">Review the values by hand</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-11", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-11/04"><data key="label">Link to a transaction or create one</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-11", "order": 4}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-12/01"><data key="label">Upload a statement file and start an import</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-12", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-12/02"><data key="label">Review rows, mapping and duplicates</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-12", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-12/03"><data key="label">Confirm: rows become transactions</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-12", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-12/04"><data key="label">Reconcile the account against statement lines</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-12", "order": 4}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-12/05"><data key="label">Undo an import if needed</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-12", "order": 5}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-13/01"><data key="label">Create a savings goal</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-13", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-13/02"><data key="label">Add a contribution</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-13", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-13/03"><data key="label">See progress and forecast</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-13", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-14/01"><data key="label">Create a group</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-14", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-14/02"><data key="label">Invite by link or email</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-14", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-14/03"><data key="label">Invitee previews and accepts</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-14", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-15/01"><data key="label">Add a group expense with a split method</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-15", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-15/02"><data key="label">Open the expense and its shares</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-15", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-16/01"><data key="label">See balances and suggested payments</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-16", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-16/02"><data key="label">Record a partial payment</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-16", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-17/01"><data key="label">Payee confirms (or disputes) the payment</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-17", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-17/02"><data key="label">Balances update from confirmed settlements only</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-17", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-18/01"><data key="label">Create a group budget for the household</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-18", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-18/02"><data key="label">Members' shared expenses count toward it</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-18", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-18/03"><data key="label">Every member sees the shared budget's progress</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-18", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-19/01"><data key="label">Create a community with a visibility</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-19", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-19/02"><data key="label">Find and join (private: request approval)</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-19", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-19/03"><data key="label">Moderator approves the request</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-19", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-19/04"><data key="label">Invite someone to an invitation-only community</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-19", "order": 4}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-20/01"><data key="label">Write a post</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-20", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-20/02"><data key="label">Comment and reply</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-20", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-21/01"><data key="label">Join privately</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-21", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-21/02"><data key="label">Check in progress</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-21", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-21/03"><data key="label">Opt in to the leaderboard</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-21", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-22/01"><data key="label">Ask a question about one's own data (API only; no client screen)</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-22", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-23/01"><data key="label">Request an export (recent re-authentication)</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-23", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-23/02"><data key="label">Worker builds the ZIP and notifies</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-23", "order": 2}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-23/03"><data key="label">Download it through a signed, expiring link</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-23", "order": 3}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-24/01"><data key="label">Schedule deletion after re-authentication</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-24", "order": 1}</data></node>
    <node id="step:journey-24/02"><data key="label">See the grace period, or cancel</data><data key="ntype">step</data><data key="nprops">{"flow": "flow:journey-24", "order": 2}</data></node>
